{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_E0721582","title":"Alan Fontus Second Meeting","entry":"Dlg_E0721582::entry","exit":"Dlg_E0721582::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_FEF6E21F","articyId":"72057615512833128","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Alan Fontus","text":"I wondered if our paths might cross again.","speakerId":"Ntt_47EFC7D8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I wondered if our paths might cross again.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":550.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"23214","byteOffset":16664912,"byteLength":388}},{"id":"DFr_7E6D47DA","articyId":"72057615512833149","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Alan Fontus","text":"Time time time. It's always time.","speakerId":"Ntt_47EFC7D8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Time time time. It's always time.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1175.0,"y":700.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26830","byteOffset":18029720,"byteLength":344}},{"id":"DFr_55584C57","articyId":"72057615512833163","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Alan Fontus","text":"I've been thinking more since last we spoke. You gave me a lot to think about.","speakerId":"Ntt_47EFC7D8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I've been thinking more since last we spoke. You gave me a lot to think about.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":1775.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38434","byteOffset":28874360,"byteLength":424}},{"id":"DFr_558CDB4B","articyId":"72057615512833177","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Alan Fontus","text":"It's rare to come across a person as young as yourself with such a storied history.","speakerId":"Ntt_47EFC7D8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It's rare to come across a person as young as yourself with such a storied history.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2325.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26719","byteOffset":17987008,"byteLength":392}},{"id":"DFr_A9088EF1","articyId":"72057615512833192","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Alan Fontus","text":"The best thinkers rarely do.","speakerId":"Ntt_47EFC7D8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The best thinkers rarely do.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2325.0,"y":700.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19174","byteOffset":15138600,"byteLength":336}},{"id":"DFr_1189A586","articyId":"72057615512833234","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Alan Fontus","text":"Ahhhhh so here we are. As with all things, this was only a matter of time.","speakerId":"Ntt_47EFC7D8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ahhhhh so here we are. As with all things, this was only a matter of time.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":2925.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22286","byteOffset":16317280,"byteLength":384}},{"id":"DFr_CB9109A4","articyId":"72057615512833257","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Alan Fontus","text":"I trust the winds have found you well?","speakerId":"Ntt_47EFC7D8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I trust the winds have found you well?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1175.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25105","byteOffset":17379776,"byteLength":348}},{"id":"DFr_A8B53EA4","articyId":"72057615512833286","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Alan Fontus","text":"I knew my research was always of interest to the Nimbus Nobles who live above the clouds. Now that I have concluded my studies, it only makes sense that the Spire would find me.","speakerId":"Ntt_47EFC7D8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I knew my research was always of interest to the Nimbus Nobles who live above the clouds. Now that I have concluded my studies, it only makes sense that the Spire would find me.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":3475.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18309","byteOffset":14813768,"byteLength":524}},{"id":"DFr_4EB18DFF","articyId":"72057615512833307","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Alan Fontus","text":"Look, I found my way, Thaddeus found his. When you think about it, we all find our own path. The plumbing of eternity is long and winding. We must find our individual leaky pipe to drink from.","speakerId":"Ntt_47EFC7D8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Look, I found my way, Thaddeus found his. When you think about it, we all find our own path. The plumbing of eternity is long and winding. We must find our individual leaky pipe to drink from.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4650.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36567","byteOffset":28178600,"byteLength":500}},{"id":"DFr_E58D7046","articyId":"72057615512833314","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Alan Fontus","text":"Spire or not, something sent you here.","speakerId":"Ntt_47EFC7D8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Spire or not, something sent you here.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4050.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50529","byteOffset":33456544,"byteLength":348}},{"id":"DFr_3C272909","articyId":"72057615512833329","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Alan Fontus","text":"I'm not sure how much clearer I could make this.","speakerId":"Ntt_47EFC7D8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'm not sure how much clearer I could make this.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":5225.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37880","byteOffset":28665768,"byteLength":392}},{"id":"DFr_78C66D92","articyId":"72057615512833350","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Alan Fontus","text":"Yes yes yes! Precisely, it took me centuries to even open my eyes. You are but a child.","speakerId":"Ntt_47EFC7D8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yes yes yes! Precisely, it took me centuries to even open my eyes. You are but a child.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5800.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27058","byteOffset":18115912,"byteLength":396}},{"id":"DFr_B2A45783","articyId":"72057615512833357","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Alan Fontus","text":"Nothing here makes sense, and it will begin to make less sense very soon.","speakerId":"Ntt_47EFC7D8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Nothing here makes sense, and it will begin to make less sense very soon.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":5800.0,"y":700.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38857","byteOffset":29032528,"byteLength":384}},{"id":"DFr_B3F47522","articyId":"72057615512833372","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Alan Fontus","text":"Make? No one can make a person live, not truly. Offer them a choice? Maybe. For now you must leave me. I have a lot to think about.","speakerId":"Ntt_47EFC7D8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Make? No one can make a person live, not truly. Offer them a choice? Maybe. For now you must leave me. I have a lot to think about.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":6400.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49419","byteOffset":33037696,"byteLength":440}},{"id":"DFr_948984E8","articyId":"72057615512833135","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"It's good to see you.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It's good to see you.","TextSheVersion":"It's good to see you.","TextTheyVersion":"It's good to see you."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":875.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33607","byteOffset":20597336,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_102A7C26","articyId":"72057615512833142","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Time for more riddles?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Time for more riddles?","TextSheVersion":"Time for more riddles?","TextTheyVersion":"Time for more riddles?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":875.0,"y":700.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30520","byteOffset":19426712,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_F8095295","articyId":"72057615512833156","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I'll take that as a \"yes.\"","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'll take that as a \"yes.\"","TextSheVersion":"I'll take that as a \"yes.\"","TextTheyVersion":"I'll take that as a \"yes.\""},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1475.0,"y":700.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31739","byteOffset":19888216,"byteLength":308}},{"id":"DFr_6BB017BD","articyId":"72057615512833170","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I'm glad to hear that.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'm glad to hear that.","TextSheVersion":"I'm glad to hear that.","TextTheyVersion":"I'm glad to hear that."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2050.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49410","byteOffset":33034192,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_E541DC80","articyId":"72057615512833184","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"But I hardly said anything.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"But I hardly said anything.","TextSheVersion":"But I hardly said anything.","TextTheyVersion":"But I hardly said anything."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2050.0,"y":700.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47126","byteOffset":32162472,"byteLength":308}},{"id":"DFr_4A41AEF2","articyId":"72057615512833199","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Hey... are you like those people in the Spire who want to cheat death?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText"